    "text": "In series $R=R_1+R_2$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{2 \\ell}{K_{e f f} A}=\\frac{\\ell}{K_1 A}+\\frac{\\ell}{K_2 A} \\\\ & K_{e f f}=\\frac{24}{7}=3.43\\end{aligned}$",
